WEBVTT

00:02.680 --> 00:07.573
No let Zhu Yuanzhi go why am I worse than Zhu Yuanzhi?

00:10.200 --> 00:14.987
I'm not just Prince of Jin but also your brother-in-law this is a near-suicide mission.

00:15.200 --> 00:21.253
If something happens to you I'm afraid I'll lose my composure then how can we defend the city?

00:29.280 --> 00:35.720
Xie Xuan is impulsive and emotional leads elite cavalry out of the city who knows how many will return.

00:42.760 --> 00:44.880
Mount up gag yourselves.

00:46.500 --> 01:06.500
Seeing the elites of the Eastern Camp approaching rapidly, Zhu Yuanzhi decisively abandoned the rescue of his comrades, leading the remaining cavalry in retreat.

